{
  "name": "Second Brain – Google Calendar Sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📅 Google Calendar sync helper\n**Arah app → Google (direkomendasikan):** tiap 30 menit `POST /api/public/n8n/calendar/sync`. Server memakai koneksi per-user (App User Connector, handle terenkripsi di `app_user_connections`) untuk menjalankan logika `syncTaskToGoogle` pada tugas bertanggal yang berubah sejak sync terakhir. **Kredensial Google user tidak pernah melewati n8n.**\n\n**Arah Google → app (opsional, single-user, disabled):** Google Calendar Trigger (kalender milik owner, kredensial OAuth n8n) → event baru dengan tag `#task` di judul/deskripsi → `POST /api/public/n8n/capture` (target `task`). Event yang dibuat app (punya `google_event_id`) diabaikan server agar tidak loop.\n\n**Env:** `SECOND_BRAIN_URL`, `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`, `TELEGRAM_ADMIN_CHAT_ID`, `SECOND_BRAIN_OWNER_EMAIL`.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 760,
        "color": "6"
      },
      "id": "ad346d6f-4fa3-4539-9407-9a2426d9c60e",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "2d7f5cf3-4e36-47be-a571-4d9f17eee0a7",
      "name": "Tiap 30 menit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SECOND_BRAIN_URL }}/api/public/n8n/calendar/sync",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ since_minutes: 45, limit: 200 }) }}"
      },
      "id": "9d717a6c-0f2e-411a-9361-86a4d3905ce3",
      "name": "Sync app → Google",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 10000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Second Brain x-api-key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const r = $json;\nconst failed = (r.results || []).filter(x => !x.ok);\nif (!failed.length) return [];\nreturn [{ json: { text: `📅 Calendar sync: ${r.synced ?? 0} OK, ${failed.length} gagal\\n` + failed.slice(0, 10).map(f => `• ${f.title || f.task_id}: ${f.error}`).join('\\n') } }];"
      },
      "id": "29889fe2-c2d3-4723-9aa1-11eaf423b4d2",
      "name": "Ada yang gagal?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.telegram.org/bot{{ $env.TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN }}/sendMessage",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ chat_id: $env.TELEGRAM_ADMIN_CHAT_ID, text: $json.text.slice(0, 4000) }) }}"
      },
      "id": "a67ad4b5-988c-48d3-934d-9cd99e3c5589",
      "name": "Lapor admin",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyX",
              "value": 15,
              "unit": "minutes"
            }
          ]
        },
        "calendarId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "primary"
        },
        "triggerOn": "eventCreated",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cb5229ef-a4db-4a3e-bb22-13e338da5331",
      "name": "Google Calendar Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendarTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        260
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Google Calendar (owner)"
        }
      },
      "disabled": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Hanya event yang ditandai #task, dan bukan event yang dibuat app sendiri.\nconst out = [];\nfor (const i of $input.all()) {\n  const e = i.json;\n  const text = `${e.summary || ''}\\n${e.description || ''}`;\n  if (!/#task\\b/i.test(text)) continue;\n  if (e.extendedProperties?.private?.second_brain_task_id) continue;\n  out.push({ json: { payload: {\n    user_email: $env.SECOND_BRAIN_OWNER_EMAIL,\n    source: 'google_calendar',\n    target: 'task',\n    text: (e.summary || 'Event').replace(/#task\\b/ig, '').trim(),\n    description: (e.description || '').replace(/#task\\b/ig, '').trim() || null,\n    start_date: e.start?.dateTime || e.start?.date || null,\n    due_date: e.end?.dateTime || e.end?.date || null,\n    external_id: `gcal:${e.id}`,\n    google_event_id: e.id,\n    url: e.htmlLink || null,\n  } } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "e30e8a69-c0c4-4de7-827b-cbf7dce891a6",
      "name": "Filter #task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SECOND_BRAIN_URL }}/api/public/n8n/capture",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.payload) }}"
      },
      "id": "e8da6156-f1e4-4ad2-8764-1f11931a1fb8",
      "name": "Capture → task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        260
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Second Brain x-api-key"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Tiap 30 menit": {
      "main": [
